<title>SPAIN: Endesa unaffected by public offer announcement.</title>
<headline>Endesa unaffected by public offer announcement.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spain's Endesa showed no significant changes after the Industry Ministry announced the sale today of 35 pct of its capital in a public share offer set to begin in late September.</p>
<p>&quot;The news was practically known and does not change any forecasts surrounding the stock&quot;, said a trader at a foreign bank.</p>
<p>Endesa shares were 20 pesetas down at 3,100 at 1253 GMT and showed no change against their price before the announcement. The IBEX-35 index was down 96.66 points, or 1.37 percent, 6863.70.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
